.*
.* A display panel, its key list, the classes its variables belong to
.* and the conditions that control it.
.*
.* Member: PNLPANEL
.* Source: Application Display Programming SC41-5715 (V6R1), appendix A.
.* Retrieved: 2026-07-28
.*
:pnlgrp submsgf='*LIBL/QCPFMSG'.
.*
.* From "Example: Validity Checking" in the reference.
.* wrapped in the class definitions the checks belong to.
:class name=qty basetype='*DEC 5 0'.
:CHECK RANGE='1 10' REL='= 99' MSGID=USR0234.
:CHECK REL='< 5' REL='> 10' MSGID=USR1234.
:eclass.
:class name=answer basetype='*CHAR 4'.
:CHECK VALUES='"*YES" "*NO"'
MSGID=MMM0001 MSGF=USRMSGF.
:eclass.
.*
.* The reference gives the special values as the spelling to
.* prefer for a relational operator, because the not character
.* is outside the invariant character set.
:class name=seqnbr basetype='*DEC 3 0'.
:check rel='*GE 1' rel='*LE 999' msgid=USR0002 msgf='*LIBL/USRMSG'.
:eclass.
.*
.* Variables, and the record an application exchanges.
:var name=ordqty class=qty errvar=qtyerr.
:var name=confirm class=answer.
:var name=seq class=seqnbr.
:varrcd name=ordrcd vars='ordqty confirm seq'.
.*
.* From "Example: Truth Table" in the reference.
.* with the conditions its columns name defined first.
:cond name=A expr='ordqty > 0'.
:cond name=B expr='confirm = "*YES"'.
:cond name=C expr='seq > 0'.
:tt name=tt1 conds='A B C'.
:ttrow      values='1 0 0'.
:ttrow      values='0 1 0'.
:ttrow      values='0 0 1'.
:ett.
.*
.* From "Example: Key Definitions" in the reference.
:keyl name=keylist
          help=hkeylist.
:keyi key=f3
          action='exit set'
          help=exit
          .F3=End task
:keyi key=f5
          action='return 5'
          help=refresh
          .F5=Refresh
:keyi key=f11
          action=chgview
          help=chgview
          .F11=Alternate view
:keyi key=f12
          action='cancel set'
          help=cancel
          .F12=Cancel
:ekeyl.
.*
.* From "Example: Menu Bar" in the reference.
.* completed with the choices and pull-down fields the book
.* shows in its displayed output.
.* Menu bar for Work with Programs panel
:mbar name=mbarpgm
        help='mbarpgm/'
        maxbarl=40.
:mbarc help='mbarpgm/file'.File
:pdfld.
:pdfldc option=1 help='pdfld/change' action='CMD CHGPGM'.Change
:pdaccel.F4
:pdfldc option=9 help='pdfld/exit' action='EXIT'.Exit
:epdfld.
:embarc.
:embar.
.*
.* The panel, its areas and the items in them.
:panel name=ordpnl help=hordpnl keyl=keylist mbar=mbarpgm topsep=space.Order entry
:data depth='*' help=hdata layout=1.
:topinst.Type choices, press Enter.
:datacol width=20.
:datagrp help=hgrp name=ordg grpsep=space.
:datai var=ordqty usage=inout help=hqty required=yes.Quantity
:dataix var=seq usage=inout newline=no itemsep=space.Sequence
:edatagrp.
:dataslt type=single var=confirm help=hconf required=yes.Confirm
:datasltc choice=1 option='*YES' help=hyes.Yes
:datasltc choice=2 option='*NO' help=hno.No
:datac.More choices
:botinst.Press F1 for help on any field.
:edata.
:info depth=4 botsep=space scroll=yes.
:p.Orders are held for seven days before they are released.
:einfo.
:text var=ordnote row=3 col=2.
:appfmt var=ordarea width=20 depth=4 usrexit='CALL ORDFMT'.
:optline name=ordopt.
:cmdline size=long name=ordcmd.Selection or command
:epanel.
:epnlgrp.
